{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-09-22T08:25:12.667Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"122e8c182cc2e3da5c576b7a","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-web-0d60"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"A publish that npm accepts late is reported as failed and the GitHub Release is skipped on bun mirror lag"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The release workflow treated npm's eventual visibility and the bun mirror as immediate, so a publish the registry accepted a few minutes late was reported as failed and the GitHub Release step was skipped on bun mirror lag. The publish reconcile window is widened to 20 x 30s (10 minutes) with npm view --prefer-online and an honest never-visible message; the GitHub Release now depends only on publish + tag push succeeding, while a dedicated gate step fails the job visibly when bun verification fails after a 21-attempt bun window with a final re-check (no backfill step; it was removed in review). Companion item pm-cli-website-3y5d; proof: stub harness 5/5 passing on the patched file, 4/5 failing on the unpatched file."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["release","reliability"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-09-22T08:25:12.667Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-22T08:25:12.667Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"pi-agent"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"5d98439366eb821790d854af8be32d7f4c5d910967bd94b7269b296074e